# r25-unacked-worker-notify — R25 PM ack-debt notify E2E scenario.
#
# Validates the agent_settled → unackedRequiresAckRecords → deliverMessageLocked(root)
# path when a worker settles (turn-end / final-turn stop) while still holding a live, non-superseded
# requiresAck message addressed to it. Plan §3 scenario:
#   "worker spawn taskless → ack-required message → settle/stop → root nhận notify"
#
# This fixture is the engine-side artifact: it provides a deterministic terminal turn so the
# worker's pi session reaches agent_settled naturally. The pre-existing unacked message is
# seeded on disk by the lane harness BEFORE the lane starts (see agents/mock-llm-scenarios
# pattern 2: "seeded world + single-actor script"). Without seeding, the message count is zero
# and the R25 predicate is a no-op (this is by design — the fixture itself does not deliver
# mailbox messages; it documents the scenario + gives the lane a clean terminal turn).
#
# Model id = r25-unacked-worker-notify. Lane form:
#   pi -e ./extensions/swarm -e ./extensions/mock-llm --provider mock-llm \
#      --model r25-unacked-worker-notify -p 'idle' \
#      # with PI_SWARM_AGENT_ID=r25-worker + cwd seeded with the unacked message
#
# Three turns: text ack-of-task -> text confirm-then-stop. Total runtime <120ms; lane then exits
# cleanly so the engine fires agent_settled.
{"name":"r25 turn 0 ack-receipt","events":[{"type":"text","delayMs":15,"text":"R25 turn 0: worker received the seeded requiresAck message but has not yet acked. Standing by for task body before settling."}]}
{"name":"r25 turn 1 settle-confirm","events":[{"type":"text","delayMs":15,"text":"R25 turn 1: worker has not acked the seeded message and the turn is ending. The engine's agent_settled handler will now scan unackedRequiresAckRecords, find the seeded live message, and deliver the root notify."}]}
{"name":"r25 turn 2 final-stop","stopReason":"stop","events":[{"type":"text","delayMs":10,"text":"R25 lane complete. After this stop, the worker settles; the root mailbox should now contain the ack-debt notify."},{"type":"stop","delayMs":5,"reason":"stop"}]}
